        <mxCell id="c-20" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;　ActiveResourceManager.checkResourceDeclarations()&lt;br&gt;diff：已有 worker − 声明数 → requestNewWorker()&lt;br&gt;→ YarnResourceManagerDriver.requestResource()" vertex="1">
